Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.58,0:00:11.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I went to CosStream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I used to go when I was younger cause they're\None of the few events with industry booths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:19.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi's here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:21.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Doing another new character, I assume.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I haven't kept up so I'm out of the loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:26.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That being said...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:29.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I missed cosplay events so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.79,0:00:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm here to see my students today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:34.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm working overtime as their advisor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:39.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(755.2,273.6)}{\an7}Cosplay Changing Rooms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:40.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh God!\NI was on autopilot to the goddamn changing rooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:41.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(448,331.2)}{\an7}Dressing Room: Nagomi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.63,0:00:43.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're good, Nagomi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.71,0:00:47.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks! She's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.75,0:00:49.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great craftsmanship, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.33,0:00:54.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The bust might be a bit tight,\Nso let me know if you need it adjusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.25,0:00:57.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that. I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:01:01.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You still thinking about that Liliel?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.42,0:01:07.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've never seen you get this worked up\Nabout a newbie before, Nagomi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:11.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,She does this all the time,\Nbut I've got to get her to cool off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.96,0:01:13.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,She reminded me of Mayura.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.71,0:01:20.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,When I saw her pic,\NI could tell how much she loved the character.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.25,0:01:23.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just like Mayura-sama, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.29,0:01:29.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I always did the most popular characters so\NI could be the biggest cosplayer out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I promoted the hell out of myself, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.79,0:01:35.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,But no matter how hard I tried,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.00,0:01:38.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura-sama and her Lustalotte\Ncosroms always outsold mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:43.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then she freakin' retired on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.42,0:01:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait, so that was you taking it out on her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.29,0:01:52.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't make me out to be some bully!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:01:56.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's definitely got skill, but she's wasting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:02:00.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,She'll never get anywhere if she restricts\Nherself to a single character.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.88,0:02:03.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,She'll end up screwing herself over someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:07.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay is art. Why limit yourself like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.25,0:02:12.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love all cosplay, no matter where it's coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:16.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wish you'd act like it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.67,0:02:18.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or this'll end up screwing YOU over someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.54,0:02:21.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,So that's why you said that?\NTo get her to try other things?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.75,0:02:24.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I said it 'cause I don't like her and\NI wanted her to feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.75,0:02:26.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:33.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But if that's enough to make her upset,\Nshe's not gonna last long, anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:08.96,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,403.2)}{\an7}You're Not Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:18.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've barely gotten started!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:20.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,We were gonna head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:21.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:29.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe... I don't love cosplay enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.63,0:04:35.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Milady Magino, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:37.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-where's Liliel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:43.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.25,0:04:45.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's just taking extra time to put on her costume!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:46.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.92,0:04:49.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,If something's wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.67,0:04:51.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,it's up to you to make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:53.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:55.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'd talked about this, but damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:04:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It really is a ghost town out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:02.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That kind of sucks,\Nbut we might as well get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:03.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.67,0:05:05.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san! Let's do it out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here comes the Queen herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.63,0:05:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's Miss Nagomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,She definitely has a different vibe,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.13,0:05:22.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,like this is just her everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:24.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it confidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.79,0:05:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,From her expression to her aura,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:28.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,she looks exactly like Icola's art.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:30.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But Liliel looks just as good as she does!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:35.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san, no stopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:39.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, I saw him! He was right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:40.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? Saw who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.33,0:05:42.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You guys gotta settle down and listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:44.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think you're the one who needs to settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:47.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I saw him out there! My Kai-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.29,0:05:50.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are her 2D delusions getting that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm telling the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:56.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Was it a daydream? A hallucination?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:06:02.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is God rewarding me for all my hard work\Nby bringing my darling Kai-sama to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.54,0:06:08.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,She really does live off in la-la land, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.00,0:06:09.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I be cringe for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.79,0:06:10.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.46,0:06:12.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I caught feels!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.88,0:06:15.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:16.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:18.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:21.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to put on my best cosplay performance ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.75,0:06:24.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Show me the Icola info sheet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:24.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:26.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I've never seen her this excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.21,0:06:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,17 years old, lives alone in the country,\Nsecretly the daughter of a powerful mage...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:32.63,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(345.6,108)}{\an7}ICOLA\N{\pos(307.2,230.4)}{\an7}A 17-year-old girl who lives alone in the countryside.\N{\pos(384,280.8)}{\an7}Secretly the daughter of a powerful mage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:37.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's all the info we've got, besides her art...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll have to imagine her personality myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:43.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,My portrayal of her might be the first\Nimpression the public gets of her...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:49.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,How does she smile? What scents surround her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:52.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's her hometown like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.13,0:06:54.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:57.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.54,0:07:05.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, could I borrow Nagomi-san for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.13,0:07:08.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't think so. Not now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:10.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's already headed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:13.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.83,0:07:16.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's been an hour since the event started,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:19.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,and barely anyone has come by.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't anyone left the industry booth area?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:24.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.33,0:07:26.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll come with you, seeing as no one's around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:29.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:37.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is everyone doing outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What are they taking pictures of?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:40.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Some cool bird or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:44.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I can't believe this is happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.25,0:07:44.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.88,0:07:46.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I know what they're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:49.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,All of these people...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.13,0:07:53.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,...are taking pictures of Nagomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.13,0:07:56.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.00,0:07:57.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,This kind of crowd at an event this
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.75,0:07:59.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,size is completely unheard of!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:05.29,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(448,410.4)}{\an7}NAGOMI Photo Area
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:02.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come outside for photos of Nagomi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:05.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san is over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:07.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The crowd must have been
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,too big for the industry space,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:12.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,so they moved it outside...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.88,0:08:15.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is what it means to be a top cosplayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.13,0:08:17.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should have known!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:21.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san needs a ten-minute break!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.00,0:08:22.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pardon us, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:26.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san, drink some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:30.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't drag me back to reality without warning me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:32.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,One more hour, and we'll go back to the booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:38.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, but I still haven't spotted Kai-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:40.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,He might be in the crowd some-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:43.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:45.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can see the face of every photographer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:57.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seems like we'll just have to wait till\NNagomi-chan is done with her shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:58.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:09:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,By then, all the attendees will have gone home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:07.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's so confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.00,0:09:10.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,He knows she'll make it work,\Ndespite our current situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:11.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where is she, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.71,0:09:13.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,She should be done by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.83,0:09:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah... I'll give her a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:24.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa? Everything okay, Ririsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.42,0:09:25.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did she forget something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.71,0:09:27.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've probably got a spare if she needs it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:30.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it's worse than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.58,0:09:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't find my skirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.88,0:09:35.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:42.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-you can't find your skirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you leave it at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,N-no, I know I put it in my suitcase...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.04,0:09:56.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could someone have grabbed it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:59.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,when you weren't looking,\Nthinking it was theirs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.63,0:10:01.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,That would make things difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.67,0:10:04.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no way we could ask every\Ncosplayer if they've seen it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:06.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe just the Liliel cosplayers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.67,0:10:08.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, let's ask Lost and Found first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.79,0:10:10.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go check Lost and Found!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:11.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Someone might've turned it in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:12.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.29,0:10:18.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, wait. It's... It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:22.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's really fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.13,0:10:33.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't love cosplay enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.13,0:10:37.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, who loses a big piece of their costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:45.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve to wear my Liliel cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:49.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ririsa-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:51.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're still thinking about what she said?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:52.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,She was wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:54.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.13,0:10:58.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san said that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:00.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-that sent her spiraling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:04.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, c'mon, it probably meant a lot to Ririsa...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.29,0:11:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:07.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.75,0:11:09.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.88,0:11:11.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Remember what I told you:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:14.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,if you have something to say,\Nthen say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.33,0:11:16.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:25.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,R-Ririsa, don't just give up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.21,0:11:29.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,We made a promise! We're gonna do this, together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know, but-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:34.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What about our club room?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:36.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I shouldn't bring that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.54,0:11:38.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's my job to deal with our club room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do I need from her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.88,0:11:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.63,0:11:46.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.38,0:11:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,We need to write that report,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:48.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,or we'll lose our room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:49.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who cares if we lose our room?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:56.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The room stopped being an issue the second\Nwe decided not to use that other report.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:11:58.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,How can you be cool with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:00.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're doing this for yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,because you want to cosplay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but... Is that a good enough reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:16.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,My only other reason is to show\Neveryone how much I love Liliel, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:23.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I could do that by making a doujinshi,\Nor buying merch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.83,0:12:26.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't need to cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:28.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're overthinking things!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.63,0:12:30.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are you taking this so seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.75,0:12:32.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with taking it this seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.88,0:12:35.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, so why did you even bother cosplaying before?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.83,0:12:43.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I wish I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.63,0:12:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:48.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Riri-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:53.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Magino-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.54,0:12:56.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I should've mentioned one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:59.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once you've said everything you want to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:01.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,you need to know when to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.83,0:13:05.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't say anything you don't truly mean.\NLet it end there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:09.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.17,0:13:13.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Okumura-kun! Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:15.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're just gonna leave her here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You two should go get your pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:22.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But what about...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.25,0:13:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is Ririsa's problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.71,0:13:27.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura, milord, let's talk over here! Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.63,0:13:29.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:36.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,M-my student is in trouble... She needs her advisor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.79,0:13:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayuri-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.79,0:13:44.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've got such good fashion sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.79,0:13:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you think this is good,\Nthen I know you've got zero fashion sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.42,0:13:51.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I heard what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:54.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:14:00.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've never seen Senpai that mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:04.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's my fault. I made him angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.79,0:14:07.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I disappointed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:10.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.92,0:14:12.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm a horrible person!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.54,0:14:15.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can't know how someone feels,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:17.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,so don't make assumptions like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.67,0:14:21.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Though it's good that you're being considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.25,0:14:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're not mad at me, Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.71,0:14:29.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I made all those promises to you, but here I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:31.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.13,0:14:33.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm your teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.79,0:14:36.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,And teachers don't get mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:42.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, they do, but like...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:45.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, here, let me tell you a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.50,0:14:50.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,When I was in high school,\NI didn't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.46,0:14:52.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was tough...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.75,0:14:55.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,not being able to talk about the things I liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:58.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,She was just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:14:58.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is the character you want to make?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.54,0:15:06.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her outfit is so cute. Here's how I would do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:11.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,My home ec teacher gave me the support I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.75,0:15:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,She never got annoyed with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:18.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whatever I came to her with,\Nshe'd say, "Great, go do it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.71,0:15:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that why you decided to become a home ec teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:23.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,...Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:24.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:27.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait... Is that why I went into teaching?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:29.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did I forget? What's wrong with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:40.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I told myself teaching was the most stable career option.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.17,0:15:44.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess I did follow my dreams after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:51.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can't escape the things you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:52.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:55.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's why I'm so determined to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:58.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know what I can do for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.96,0:16:03.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're not cosplaying,\Nthen I don't need to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:06.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go get some work done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:08.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay. Sorry, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.33,0:16:12.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Listen! Mayuri-sensei is leaving, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:13.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.67,0:16:14.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,This'll be on the test!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.58,0:16:15.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:23.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now I've disappointed both of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:28.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,"You can't know how someone feels,\Nso don't make assumptions like that."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, has anyone brought in\Na bag with part of a costume inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.21,0:16:34.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I have a question!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:35.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.83,0:16:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a Liliel skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:40.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you think you might have grabbed it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:42.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can't get changed without it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:45.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I'll check my bags!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:47.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll check mine, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.33,0:16:49.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll ask around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.21,0:16:50.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is Ririsa's problem, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.92,0:17:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,So that means it's my problem, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.96,0:17:05.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to find her Liliel skirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:09.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura-kun's such a sweet guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.25,0:17:10.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm a little jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.25,0:17:11.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Milady Magino?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.96,0:17:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wish I knew what to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.33,0:17:37.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,M... Mayura-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:41.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank God I was on autopilot and\Nbrought my costume with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's been three years, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.63,0:17:46.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, you remember me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.29,0:17:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course. I've been hoping to see you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:52.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:55.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I started cosplaying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.96,0:17:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be a cosplayer just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.00,0:18:06.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But now, I'm not sure if I have the\Nright reason to be cosplaying, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.75,0:18:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe you could tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.13,0:18:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's the reason you cosplay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:11.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:13.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's complicated!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.67,0:18:15.33,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(243.2,194.4)}{\an7}INTENSE
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.67,0:18:15.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can you be more specific?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.92,0:18:18.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,At first, I did it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:22.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to distance myself from the shy wallflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:24.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be someone different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.04,0:18:30.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But as I got into cosplay, I started doing it for Lustalotte.\NShe was my reason for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.42,0:18:33.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,And as I got more famous,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.67,0:18:36.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I sometimes felt I had a duty to cosplay at certain events.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.21,0:18:40.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, I cosplayed just to cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:43.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I did it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:49.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm cosplaying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.79,0:18:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.67,0:19:00.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You taught me an important lesson, you know:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:03.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,The reason really doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.46,0:19:08.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I cosplay because I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:10.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just can't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:14.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,How about you? Do you want to cosplay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course I do! I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.46,0:19:19.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.88,0:19:23.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've got a partner who feels the same way, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.67,0:19:31.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,My favorite is when the hero\Ncomes rushing in to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:35.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:38.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We found it! We've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.08,0:19:40.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.92,0:19:45.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! I grabbed it when I was in a rush...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.71,0:19:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:52.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Thanks for helping us find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.88,0:19:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Ririsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:01.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I wasn't... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.83,0:20:07.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Remember all the things you love?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.96,0:20:13.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You love Liliel, sexy costumes, and cosplay, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.75,0:20:16.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you're sure that's good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.71,0:20:20.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,A real otaku NEVER judges\Nsomeone by the things they love!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:24.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,And it doesn't matter how you show that love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:26.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no one 'right' way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.42,0:20:32.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whatever you love, however you do it,\Nall that matters is that you love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:35.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,And who cares if someone else doesn't believe that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:40.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Someone might talk shit about that, sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:44.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,but that's not because of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.38,0:20:47.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe they've got their own shit going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.42,0:20:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,or something they're afraid to admit out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.42,0:20:56.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But if that ever gets to you,\Nand you lose faith in yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.04,0:20:58.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,if your heart ever starts to break,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be there for you! I'll be right there, rooting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.54,0:21:05.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Liliel is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.79,0:21:09.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,No. You're not Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:13.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not because you're Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:15.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.96,0:21:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.33,0:21:21.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You are Ririsa Amano!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.38,0:21:23.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa, the cosplayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.29,0:21:25.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa, who's got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.17,0:21:28.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa, who's gonna cosplay Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:32.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,R-right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:38.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura, milord!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.79,0:21:40.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You found her missing piece?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:41.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:43.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry about the scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.54,0:21:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's good, because Nagomi is
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.29,0:21:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,nearly done with her photo shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:48.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,In fifteen mintues,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:50.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,all the attendees are gonna start heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.75,0:21:53.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It takes me an hour to get into costume...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:57.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah... And by then, everyone will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Twist my arm, why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.25,0:22:03.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, Lady Mayura?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.79,0:22:08.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,And that's the cosplay you were going\Nto debut at last year's Winter Comiket!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.42,0:22:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whaaa?! W-why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.63,0:22:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you going to let your partner's
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.38,0:22:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,hard work go to waste?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:17.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But there's no time...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.42,0:22:21.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then I suppose you need your advisor...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.21,0:22:23.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,...to give the performance of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:24:00.42,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(448,388.8)}{\an7}Mayura vs. Nagomi!!
